sentences.text:
The Appellant is granted an interim suspension of sentence upon furnishing a personal bond in the sum of Rs. 20,000/- with one surety in the like amount to the satisfaction of the concerned Trial Court/Metropolitan Magistrate, subject to the following conditions:-
(i) The Appellant shall report to the local Police Station on every Monday during the period of six weeks;
(ii) The Appellant shall not leave the NCT of Delhi without prior permission of the Ld. Trial Court;
(iii) The Appellant shall give his mobile number to the concerned Investigating Officer and keep the same This is a digitally signed order.

